/*
 * Vurliqo - Lovable Cloud Configuration
 * Phase 2: Backend configuration managed by Lovable Cloud
 * 
 * The built-in Lovable Cloud backend is enabled through the
 * Lovable project interface (More → Database). On deployment,
 * Lovable injects the following environment variables:
 * 
 * - NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL: Your Supabase project URL
 * - NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Your Supabase anon key
 * - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY: Your Supabase service role key
 * 
 * These values are NOT meant to be set manually in .env.local
 * during development - they are provided by Lovable Cloud on
 * deployment. For local development, you can use the Lovable
 * dev server which provides these bindings.
 * 
 * DO NOT share these credentials or commit them to version control.
 * They are project secrets managed by Lovable Cloud.
 */

